        "name": "sein + personal pronouns",
        "explanation": "Use ich bin, du bist, er/sie/es ist, wir sind, ihr seid, sie/Sie sind. In statements, the conjugated verb normally occupies position 2.",
        "examples": [
          "Ich bin Essa.",
          "Sie sind Studentin.",
          "Wir sind heute hier."
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "W-questions and yes/no questions",
        "explanation": "W-questions begin with a question word such as wie, wo, was, wer. Yes/no questions usually place the verb first.",
